ark\">⚖️ Watch drama</span> <span class=\"tje-badge-sep\">|</span> <span class=\"tje-badge tje-badge-dark\">🗳️ Cast a vote</span> <span class=\"tje-badge-sep\">|</span> <span class=\"tje-badge tje-badge-dark\">🕵️ Crack the case</span></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"tje-intro\">\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">\r\n</style>\r\n⭐ You've been called for jury duty. Step into a thrilling courtroom drama where the audience is the jury. Listen to testimonies, analyze evidence, and ultimately decide… guilty or not guilty?</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"tje-hero-quote\">\r\n<p>It's not theatre you watch.&nbsp;<br class=\"tje-mobile-break\">\r\n<span class=\"quote-accent\">It's justice you deliver.</span></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-case-card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-poster\">\r\n<h3>Frankenstein<br>\r\non Trial:<br>\r\nThe Man Who<br>\r\nDefied God</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-description\">A forbidden experiment. A created being. A trail of deaths. Dr. Victor Frankenstein stands trial. His creation — assembled from human remains and brought to life through forbidden science — has already been convicted of murder. Now the court must decide whether Frankenstein himself should be held accountable for the deaths that followed his experiment. When a creator unleashes something into the world, where does his responsibility end?</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-divider\"></div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"tje-section-title\">Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"tje-highlights\">\r\n\t<li>🤩 Enjoy a live theatre courtroom drama where you decide the final verdict</li>\r\n\t<li>🫵 Vote during key moments - your decisions shape hidden angles in the case, making every show different!</li>\r\n\t<li>🕵️‍♂️ Dissect witness testimonies, unpack evidence, and weigh every argument</li>\r\n\t<li>🎢 A high-stakes case full of twists - more turns than a rollercoaster, and a verdict only you can deliver</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<main>\r\n<div class=\"tje-divider\"></div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"tje-section-title\">How it works</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-steps\">\r\n<div class=\"tje-step\"><span class=\"tje-step-num\">1</span> <span class=\"card-title\">Take your seat</span> <span class=\"card-description\">Arrive 30 min early. Doors close at show time — late entry is not permitted.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-step\"><span class=\"tje-step-num\">2</span> <span class=\"card-title\">Hear the case</span> <span class=\"card-description\">Track every testimony, spot the contradictions, and vote at key moments to steer the trial.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-step\"><span class=\"tje-step-num\">3</span> <span class=\"card-title\">Deliver your verdict</span> <span class=\"card-description\">The jury speaks. Guilty or not guilty - the outcome rests entirely with you.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-divider\"></div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"tje-section-title\">Practical info</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-info-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"tje-info-card\"><span class=\"card-icon\">⏳</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"card-label\">Duration</span><span class=\"card-title\">60 minutes</span> <span class=\"card-description\">Doors open 30 min before</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-info-card\"><span class=\"card-icon\">📍</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"card-label\">Venue</span><span class=\"card-title\">Shaw Theatre</span> <span class=\"card-description\">100-110 Euston Road, Kings Road</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-info-card\"><span class=\"card-icon\">👤</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"card-label\">Age</span><span class=\"card-title\">12+</span> <span class=\"card-description\">Under 16s must be with an adult</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-info-card\"><span class=\"card-icon\">♿</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"card-label\">Accessibility</span><span class=\"card-title\">Fully accessible</span> <span class=\"card-description\">Wheelchair zone available</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-info-card\"><span class=\"card-icon\">✨</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"card-label\">Groups &amp; Private</span><span class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"https://thejuryexperience.com/groups/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Take the stand</a></span> <span class=\"card-description\">30+ people or private show</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-info-card\"><span class=\"card-icon\">🎁</span>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"card-label\">Gift card</span><span class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"https://www.feverup.com/m/502019\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Send gift</a></span> <span class=\"card-description\">Gift memories to someone special</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq\">\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-header\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tje-section-title\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-category\" name=\"faq-cat\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-cat-summary\">About the experience</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-panel\">\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">What is The Jury Experience?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>An immersive courtroom experience inspired by Frankenstein where you are sworn in as a juror. Hear testimony from the Creature, relive the choices that led to tragedy, and confront the ultimate question: can a creator escape responsibility for what they bring into the world?</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">How long does it last?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Approximately 1 hour.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Is there sensitive content?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Yes — this experience may explore mature themes including crime, grief, and moral responsibility. Performances contain moments of intense emotional conflict.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Will there be strobe lights?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>No, there will not be any strobe lights.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Are seats numbered?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>No — seating is first-come, first-served within your purchased zone.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-category\" name=\"faq-cat\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-cat-summary\">About your tickets</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-panel\">\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">How do I find my ticket?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>No need to print. Show your Fever ticket in the app or email on arrival. Your QR code is also in your confirmation email.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">What seating zones are available?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Zone A, Zone B, Zone C, and a Wheelchair Accessible Zone. Seating is first-come, first-served within your purchased zone.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Are refunds or exchanges allowed?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>No refunds. You may change your date up to 24 hours in advance — contact us with your ticket ID or use the Exchange option in the Fever app.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Where can I buy tickets?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>On the Fever App (Apple App Store or Google Play) or the Fever website. Not available at the venue.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Can I transfer my tickets?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Yes, for free. Click “Transfer tickets” in the Fever app, or contact us with your ticket ID.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Can I book a ticket for my carer?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Guests requiring assistance are entitled to 1 free Carer/Support Worker pass. <strong>Wheelchair Accessible Zone:</strong> simply arrive with your carer — no pre-application needed. <strong>Zones A, B, or C:</strong> you must apply for a free carer ticket <em>before</em> your initial purchase. Contact us with proof of need; we will provide a voucher code to use in the same transaction.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-category\" name=\"faq-cat\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-cat-summary\">Access &amp; venue</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-panel\">\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Where is the venue?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Shaw Theatre, 100-110 Euston Road, Kings Road.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">When should I arrive?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Arrive at least 30 minutes early. Doors close 5 minutes before the start — late arrivals will not be admitted.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Is there an age requirement?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>12+. Anyone under 16 must be accompanied by an adult and requires a ticket.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Is the venue accessible?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Yes — the venue is wheelchair accessible, including a dedicated Wheelchair Accessible Zone.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Can I use my phone during the performance?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>No — phones must be in silent mode for the entire performance.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Can I take photos or record?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Photos and videos may only be taken during the curtain call, without flash.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details class=\"tje-faq-item\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"tje-faq-summary\">Are service animals allowed?</summary>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-faq-content\">\r\n<p>Yes. No other pets permitted.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n</div>\r\n</details>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"tje-section-title\" style=\"margin-top:1.75rem;\">Seating Map</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"tje-map\">\r\n<p class=\"tje-map-caption\">Shaw Theatre</p>\r\n<img alt=\"Shaw Theatre seating map\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/fever-testing/image/upload/c_crop,g_north_west,h_1250,w_750/f_auto,q_auto/v1782751935/Workflows%20and%20Automations/seating_plan/classic_theatre_shaw_theatre_-_new_english.png\" style=\"width:100%; border-radius:0.75rem;\"></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"tje-tags\">Notorious Trial #1 · Frankenstein on Trial: The Man Who Defied God</p>\r\n</main>\r\n</div>",
